.TH MCP-TERMINAL-INFO 1 "@VERSION@" "mcp-terminal-docker" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mcp-terminal-info \- show MCP Terminal host integration summary
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mcp-terminal-info
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints host user, supplementary groups, Docker socket membership, host sudoers
state, published port, configuration and data paths, Docker service image
reference, container state, and systemd unit status for the
\fBmcp-terminal-docker\fR package.
.PP
After reviewing this summary, run \fBmcp-terminal-preflight\fR to validate JSON
configuration, TLS files, watch directory permissions, and Docker CLI compatibility
inside the running container.
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.EX
mcp-terminal-info
mcp-terminal-preflight
sudo journalctl -u mcp-terminal-docker -n 50
.EE
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mcp-terminal-preflight (1),
.BR mcp-terminal-config (5),
.BR mcp-terminal-docker (1)
